B.bES=new A.fA("1. Information We Collect","We collect information you provide directly to us, such as donor names, contact details, donation amounts, child welfare records, and programme notes. We also collect device information and usage data to improve app performance.")
B.bEM=new A.fA("2. How We Use Your Information","We use the information to manage donor relationships, track programme impact, generate receipts, send reminders, and fulfil our legal obligations under NGO regulations. Data is never sold or shared with third parties for commercial purposes.")
B.bEZ=new A.fA("3. Data Storage & Security","All data is stored on secured servers with AES-256 encryption. Access is restricted to authorised staff only. Regular backups are performed in compliance with Indian data protection norms.")
B.bER=new A.fA("4. Data Retention","Donor records and financial data are retained for a minimum of 7 years as required by FCRA and Income Tax regulations. Child welfare records are retained for the duration of programme participation plus 3 years.")
B.bEW=new A.fA("5. Your Rights","You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal data, except where retention is required by law. Contact our Data Officer at privacy@sakshamfoundation.org.")
B.bF2=new A.fA("6. Cookies & Analytics","Our app uses anonymous crash reporting and performance analytics only. No tracking cookies are placed on your device and we do not use advertising networks.")
B.bEN=new A.fA("7. Changes to this Policy","We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect immediately upon publishing in the app. Continued use constitutes acceptance.")
B.bEL=new A.fA("8. Contact Us","Sri Krishnashraya Educational Trust, No. 42, NGO Campus, Bengaluru \u2013 560067, Karnataka.\nEmail: privacy@sakshamfoundation.org  \xb7  Phone: +91 80 2345 6789")
B.ba3=s([B.bES,B.bEM,B.bEZ,B.bER,B.bEW,B.bF2,B.bEN,B.bEL],t.HP)
